    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d693">

                <pb facs="0860" n="772" xml:id="pg772"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/2746: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Port-au-Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-01T20:00:00-05:00">December 1, 1933—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>130. Under headlines “Complete Liberation of the Country” <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Haiti-Journal</hi> tonight publishes all documents mentioned my telegram[s]
                    128 and 129.</p>
                <p>I would appreciate information actual situation earliest possible moment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armour</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
